  "details": "SiYuan from 2.10.0 before 3.8.7 contains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability that allows users with edit permission to inject script by placing javascript: URLs in math block content rendered with KaTeX trust enabled. Attackers can store \\href, \\url, or \\includegraphics payloads that mathRender assigns via innerHTML, executing script in the application origin when a reader clicks the rendered link.",
